WEBVTT

00:00:00.860 --> 00:00:02.150
What are you doing?

00:00:03.260 --> 00:00:04.160
Hey, Johan.

00:00:04.720 --> 00:00:06.200
Which hand am I holding it in?

00:00:09.040 --> 00:00:09.360
Right.

00:00:09.960 --> 00:00:10.380
Here, Anna.

00:00:10.950 --> 00:00:11.350
It's yours.

00:00:11.890 --> 00:00:12.270
Great.

00:00:14.010 --> 00:00:15.250
Hey, let me see.

00:00:15.450 --> 00:00:16.930
Open up your hands.

00:00:19.800 --> 00:00:22.860
Behind which one are we going to take?

00:00:24.150 --> 00:00:25.110
I should have known.

00:00:25.470 --> 00:00:27.660
No matter which one, I think I would have been right.

00:00:28.060 --> 00:00:28.680
That's true.

00:00:30.160 --> 00:00:32.400
See? It's all on the A-board table.

00:00:47.720 --> 00:00:51.660
That boy's trusted life, and that's his sister.

00:00:54.340 --> 00:00:55.820
Even inside the mirror said,

00:00:56.130 --> 00:00:58.330
You are me, and I am you.

00:00:59.020 --> 00:00:59.980
No one can live ha-

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:06.220
happily with the demon here do you know what that god did after that shoot me honor it must be

00:01:06.220 --> 00:01:12.510
terrifying for him he's suffering he's in anguish and teetering on the edge of despair was my mother

00:01:12.510 --> 00:01:29.940
really trying to save me that day or did she confuse me with my sister which is it

00:01:31.050 --> 00:01:36.040
Which way is, didn't she, man?

00:01:42.390 --> 00:01:58.970
You can't do that.

00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:01.090
You and I have no name.

00:02:04.640 --> 00:02:06.920
To shoot me, like you did back then.

00:02:10.440 --> 00:02:12.610
Johan, he was crying.

00:02:14.080 --> 00:02:16.540
The same as he did back on that rainy night.

00:02:17.700 --> 00:02:19.140
If only I hadn't shot him.

00:02:21.210 --> 00:02:24.560
Johan, I, for what you did,

00:02:25.240 --> 00:02:28.180
even if we were the only two people left in the whole world,

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:30.640
I'll kill you.

00:02:31.120 --> 00:02:32.140
It's no use.

00:02:32.500 --> 00:02:34.740
Some things just cannot be undone.

00:02:35.620 --> 00:02:36.020
I'll do it.

00:02:36.310 --> 00:02:37.230
You have to do it.

00:02:37.500 --> 00:02:38.040
Don't do it!

00:02:54.100 --> 00:02:54.900
It was like,

00:02:55.900 --> 00:02:59.260
Anna and I were the only two people in the world.

00:02:59.520 --> 00:02:59.980
I'll kill her.

00:03:01.150 --> 00:03:01.810
Aren't these pretty?

00:03:05.890 --> 00:03:07.630
Don't make me forget Anna.
